<title>UK: GMAC unit sets $200 million January 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>GMAC unit sets $200 million January 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GMAC INTERNATIONAL FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    16.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE  L-16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.A     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    27.5 BP   SELL CONC  1.35 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
